# Environment configuration for autoencoders demo

# Hugging face Ccnfiguration
# ===========================
# Default: Uses pre-trained models from gperdrizet repositories
# 
# FOR STUDENTS:
# - Copy this file to .env (leave as-is to use pre-trained models)
# - No HuggingFace account or token needed to use pre-trained models
# - Models will auto-download on first run if not present locally
#
# FOR INSTRUCTORS (or anyone who wants to upload their own models):
# 1. Create HuggingFace repositories at https://huggingface.co/new
# 2. Update the repo IDs below with your repos (username/repo-name)
# 3. Get a token from https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens (write access)
# 4. Uncomment and set HF_TOKEN below
# 5. Run notebooks with train_model=True - models will auto-upload

# Dataset repository (for loading training data)
HF_REPO_ID=gperdrizet/DF2K_OST

# Model repositories (for downloading/uploading trained models)
COMPRESSION_AE_REPO=gperdrizet/compression_autoencoder
DENOISING_AE_REPO=gperdrizet/denoising_autoencoder

# Optional: Only needed for uploading
# HF_TOKEN=your_token_here
